y concrete circumstances have arisen.\u2019<sup>209</sup>  \n_Prevention_  \n- (347) Contrary to Article 5(1)(h)(i) and Article 5(1)(h)(iii) AI Act, the scenario described in Article 5(1)(h)(ii) does not specify that the use of real-time RBI is permitted to locate or identify a concrete person. Its purpose is the prevention of a particular threat. Accordingly, the scenario may also cover the use of real-time RBI to detect and follow", "type": "Document"}}